    "updated_at": "2026-11-27T14:32:20Z",
    "body": "Looks already fixed on upstream/main 4da7b3f58: the clippy step does not reproduce without a change.\n\n- The failed run 46007169125 gated 629a61caf. Its clippy step failed after 1s with exit 1. A real lint error needs a compile, so 1s points to a runner fault, not to a lint.\n- Run 46007178564 gated 52d5ff6dc. That commit contains 629a61caf. The step `clippy -D warnings` is ok in 60s and the run is green.\n- Run 46010793787 gated 4da7b3f58. The step `clippy -D warnings` is ok in 54s and the run is green.\n\nNo commit fixed a lint between 629a61caf and 52d5ff6dc. The failure was transient. Suggest closing; the maintainer decides. The next green post-merge run also closes this issue.\n",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
